WEBVTT

00:14.974 --> 00:17.997
I'm sorry.

00:24.609 --> 00:29.056
You learned to live in shifting sands With no

00:29.076 --> 00:33.903
safe place to ever land You learned that doors

00:34.124 --> 00:39.031
could slam and lock Against the ticking of the

00:39.091 --> 00:45.243
clock you learn to touch could be a cage a quiet

00:45.363 --> 00:50.891
simmering bitter rage but that old world is dead

00:50.911 --> 00:55.537
and gone it's time to face a brand new dawn so let

00:55.617 --> 01:00.220
my Let your arms be your new walls To catch you

01:00.720 --> 01:05.543
every time you fall This heart of stands, it will

01:05.643 --> 01:11.306
not break For your own precious, gentle sake If

01:11.466 --> 01:17.149
it's a heart that you should need A simple, pure,

01:17.169 --> 01:22.551
loving creed Then I am here, my love is true

01:26.248 --> 01:31.367
My arms will be a home for you.

01:53.062 --> 01:58.024
No need to brace, no need to hide With your two

01:58.104 --> 02:03.587
sisters by your side We'll be the lock, we'll be

02:03.647 --> 02:10.790
the key To your own safe reality We'll be the roof

02:10.930 --> 02:16.913
against the rain To wash away the hurt and pain

02:17.113 --> 02:20.374
This is a vow we'll always keep

02:24.088 --> 02:29.454
While you are in your troubled sleep

